The run made 7 generations on Veo 3.1 - Lite at 10 credits each, so 70 credits. All the clips are in one Flow project, "Nov 07 - 18:23". There were no refusals, sign-in prompts or captchas, and I closed the Flow tab at the end.

I checked frames by laying four points of each clip side by side in the Flow tab, because ffmpeg isn't installed. The older `*-v1.mp4` files in `clips-raw` were already there, and I left them alone. `art-src/flow-run2.log` was already untracked before I started, and I didn't commit anything.
